[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitdirlightlimit"]

; Moves the directional light limit. Nine shadowed suns with four splits each, and only the ninth
; has energy. Godot draws the first eight visible directional lights and stops
; (renderer_scene_cull.cpp:3262), so the ninth neither lights nor casts, and the ground and the post
; hold only the ambient light. Every other golden has at most two directional lights, so a light
; past the eighth is invisible there.

